{
  "id": "section-all-hell-breaks-loose",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-all-hell-breaks-loose:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "All Hell Breaks Loose\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,21,43]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-all-hell-breaks-loose:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "No one knows for sure how it\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,43,72]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-all-hell-breaks-loose:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "started. Maybe some occultists\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,72,103]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-all-hell-breaks-loose:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "played with forces they could not\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,103,137]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-all-hell-breaks-loose:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "control; or maybe, the end times\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,137,170]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-all-hell-breaks-loose:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "are really upon us. All you know is\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,170,206]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-all-hell-breaks-loose:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "that there are monsters and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,206,234]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-all-hell-breaks-loose:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "madness in the streets, all\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,234,262]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-all-hell-breaks-loose:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "communication systems and media\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,262,294]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-all-hell-breaks-loose:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have broken down – no Internet, no\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,294,329]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-all-hell-breaks-loose:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "mobile phones, no TV. Some\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,329,356]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-all-hell-breaks-loose:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "people say there is a community of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,356,391]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-all-hell-breaks-loose:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "survivors just out of town. Other\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,391,425]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-all-hell-breaks-loose:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "says these communities are just\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,425,457]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-all-hell-breaks-loose:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "traps, and are as infested by\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,457,487]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-all-hell-breaks-loose:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "demons and zombies as the city\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,487,518]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-all-hell-breaks-loose:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "streets.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,518,527]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-all-hell-breaks-loose:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You need weapons, food, water.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,527,558]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-all-hell-breaks-loose:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Driving is not safe – moving in the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,558,594]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-all-hell-breaks-loose:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "streets attracts the attention of the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,594,632]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-all-hell-breaks-loose:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "horrors, and there are gremlins\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,632,664]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-all-hell-breaks-loose:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "who apparently can control\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,664,691]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-all-hell-breaks-loose:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "vehicles and cause them to crash.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,691,725]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-all-hell-breaks-loose:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "So you’ll have to walk.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,725,749]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-all-hell-breaks-loose:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "All you have is your wits, a weapon,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,749,786]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-all-hell-breaks-loose:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "and a desire to stay alive.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[5,786,814]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    5
  ]
}
